/// register IA quest journal entries with the EE journal system ///

// ADD_JOURNAL patches BGEE.LUA/SQL so these entries work as EE quests: the first
// line of each @N is taken as the quest title, entries sharing a title share a
// quest id. Referenced at runtime by AddJournalEntry(@N,...) / EraseJournalEntry(@N)
// in IA dialogues (resources/dlg/*.d) and scripts (scripts/**/*.baf); @N resolution
// is find-or-append, so registration order relative to those references is irrelevant.
// (Was the last surviving line of the retired lib/core/strings.tph.)

ADD_JOURNAL @5510 @5511 @5512 @5513 @5514 @5515 @5516 @5517 @5518 @5519 @5520 @5521 @5522 @5523 @5524 @5525 @5526 @5527 @5528 @5529 @5530
